WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
Kaze ni kami ga nabiku

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
My hair flows in the wind.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
Kokoro ni hirogaru aozora no deai

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
An encounter in the blue skies of our hearts...

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Tooku hanaretetemo

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Though we are apart,

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
Kanjiru koto wa itsumo kimi dakara

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
I'm always thinking about you,

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
Itsu no hi ka mune wo hatte

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
so let's promise to meet again

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
Au koto wo yakusoku shiyou

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
one day, with our heads held high.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
Zutto futari owari no nai

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
We'll be together, like a dream

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
Yume wo egaku you ni

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
with no end.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
Kimi ni

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
I want

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
Kono omoi itsu no hi ka tsutaetai

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
to tell you this someday.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
Sabishisa wo shiawase ni kaeru tame

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
I'm right here next to you

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
Soba ni iru yo kokoro wa

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
to turn your loneliness into joy.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
Konna ni chikaku ni kanjiru

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
I can feel your heart so close to mine.

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:35.180
The students have been leaving the Tsukikage Acting Troupe, one after another.

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:39.300
A malicious article sparked a scandal that involved Chigusa Tsukikage.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:43.510
Onodera then hatched a plot to lure Maya's co-stars away,

00:01:43.510 --> 00:01:47.500
so that she had to take to the stage by herself. She was placed first...

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.600
in the audience vote.

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:53.990
But, due to its unconventional style, Maya's rendition...

00:01:53.990 --> 00:01:58.500
was disqualified from the competition and the Tsukikage Acting Troupe...

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.100
was disbanded for good.

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:06.080
Episode 13 - Tomorrow's Grass

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:13.590
We managed to get everything pretty clean... How did the bakery go?

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:15.630
Well, they're hiring.

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:18.580
I think I'll try my hand at tutoring.

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:20.920
And there are always care packages, so I think we'll manage.

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:24.230
You're already a high school graduate, aren't you, Rei?

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:26.140
Yeah, so I can work full time now.

00:02:26.570 --> 00:02:28.320
Let's all try our best.

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:29.140
Yeah!

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:33.090
How their eyes sparkle!

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:39.060
Youth and enthusiasm are powerful weapons!

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:44.310
Now I can finally repay all that you've done for me.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:49.370
I can find work and provide enough for you to live off.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:52.500
Please, you mustn't push yourself!

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:56.920
For you to treat me so well...

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:00.640
when you've been my servant for all these years...

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:19.150
Now, concerning next week's after-school outing, I just want to add that...

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:22.180
This is my last year in junior high.

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:25.400
I guess I won't be able to go to high school after all.

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:33.090
If I want to act, I'm going to have to find a job.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.080
Part-time Post - Needed Urgently

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:39.720
Rei!

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:40.900
Maya?

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:43.120
What's wrong?

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:46.680
It's not easy finding a decent job.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:48.960
Just keep at it, Rei.

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:52.760
Look at that!

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:55.250
Now hiring waitresses.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:00.110
Excuse me. I saw the sign outside and...

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:03.000
We're not looking for men!

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:04.270
You what?

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:08.070
<i>Excuse me</i>, but I just happen to be a...

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:10.230
Here, let me take that.

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:12.680
And then, she was so surprised, she just keeled over!

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:13.890
Here you go.

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:20.710
Can we get some cakes too?

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:22.520
Us too!

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.130
For us too!

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.400
I'll be there right away.

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:32.410
So, you found work as a waiter, did you?

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:33.860
A <i>waitress</i>.

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:35.250
Yeah, whatever.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.390
So, shall we start rehearsing?

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:42.440
"Mother, leave me alone!"

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:44.350
"I'm not a child anymore!"

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:46.680
The whole floor's shaking!

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.120
What are you doing up there?!

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.790
Sorry!

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:52.550
Excuse me...

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:57.920
Make sure you get these too...

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:58.920
Yes!

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:02.530
And this is where you apply the formula.

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:08.460
You understand it, right? So, take the formula and...

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:24.020
King Lear... I want to go see it!

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:25.270
I bet it's great.

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:32.290
Look, everyone!

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:34.880
It's Utako and Ayumi Himekawa!

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:37.790
Wow, they're so pretty!

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:40.100
Wow...

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:41.680
Ayumi...

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:47.720
Well, well, if it isn't Miss Kitajima!

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:49.880
You know, deliveries are meant for the back door.

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:51.320
You're so <i>mean</i>!

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.710
The show's about to start!

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:05.000
There are still some seats left, correct?

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:18.150
<i>O my dear father! Restoration hang</i>

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:20.970
<i>Thy medicine on my lips; and let this kiss</i>

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:22.630
<i>Repair those violent harms that my two sisters</i>

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:24.630
<i>Have in thy reverence made!</i>

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:38.210
<i>Doubtless you are my daughter Cordelia.</i>

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:38.880
Yes<i>!</i>

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:40.560
<i>Cordelia!</i>

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:42.190
<i>Cordelia!</i>

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:43.300
<i>Father!</i>

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:52.020
I didn't expect to see you here!

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:53.440
Mr. Hayami!

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:57.840
Yes, my fan invited me!

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.300
I see.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:04.250
But it's not safe for a girl to walk home alone.

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:06.050
Would you like me to give you a ride home?

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:07.430
That won't be necessary!

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:08.760
Excuse me.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:17.120
Masumi.

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:20.280
That was some rejection!

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:25.980
Is that the girl who performed a play all by herself at the National Competition?

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:27.670
Hello, Mizuki.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:32.610
Your father hired me to be your new assistant.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:34.790
So, you've been sent to keep tabs on me?

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:40.760
Masumi, isn't this the perfect time to bring up that topic of conversation with her?

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:43.200
You saw what happened when I approached her.

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:46.020
She sees us as pests.

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:49.140
You'll never talk her into anything.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:52.320
Then, what are we going to do?

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:55.840
Isn't there a boy called Sakurakouji in Ondine?

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:58.100
He's good friends with her.

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:01.860
I want you to work on him.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:05.640
You really want this girl, don't you?

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:07.720
It's my job.

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:09.790
Are you sure that's all it is?

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:16.070
Excuse me.

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:20.080
I was told that you wanted to speak to me.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:26.680
I wonder why our tutor asked us to come to this place.

00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:27.550
Yeah, me too...

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:31.690
So, you've all been called here too? Where's Ms. Tsukikage?

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.740
Ma'am!

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:38.730
We've been given this space to use for our rehearsals.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:44.430
But we must keep it clean and treat it with respect!

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:45.450
Is that understood?

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:46.940
Yes!

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:49.000
And lift!

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:54.100
Maya, you're really getting into this!

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:57.980
Yes, because once we finish, we'll finally have a place to rehearse!

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:00.900
Yeah, finally!

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:03.510
So, let's clean it up as quickly as we can!

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:05.230
Let's do it!

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:09.220
"Please, help this man!"

00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:14.940
"Though his heart is stained, look at how desperately he prays!"

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:17.950
You need to watch your feet, Sayaka.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:19.320
Maya, you're up next.

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:20.430
Yes, ma'am!

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:24.980
"Please, help this man!"

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:32.480
"Though his heart is stained, look at how desperately he prays!"

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.510
We're back!

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:38.460
Then, this will be our last exercise for today.

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:43.220
Rei, this is the front door to a haunted mansion. Now, open it.

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:57.640
Very good.

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:59.800
Maya, this is the door to a staffroom.

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:10.060
Excuse me!

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:30.980
Ma'am...

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:34.040
Is everything all right?

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:37.940
Yes. I just had a few things I wanted to mull over.

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:39.460
How's everyone else?

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:40.990
They're all asleep.

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:45.480
I'm sure everyone's exhausted and in much need of sleep...

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:47.970
after school, jobs and rehearsals.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:53.120
But, it's okay! I mean, we're all doing what we love.

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:56.820
I used to feel the same way when I was young.

00:10:56.820 --> 00:10:59.060
Back when I used to play the role of the Scarlet Angel.

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:03.800
What kind of role is it, ma'am?

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:10.810
Will I ever get to play a role in the legendary phantom masterpiece?

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:15.670
Maya.

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:16.770
Yes?

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:19.840
I want you to become a tree.

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:20.860
What?

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:23.750
Do it now.

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:35.060
Maya!

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:37.640
Does a tree move? Does it make a sound?

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:46.050
The role of the Scarlet Angel is extremely difficult, because you must cast aside your humanity.

00:11:46.770 --> 00:11:49.040
There is no one acting at the moment who can play this role,

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:51.650
though there are many talented and experienced actors around.

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:54.510
You in particular still have a long, long way to go.

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:58.530
Keep working at it... build up your experience...

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:01.720
You need to master tens of thousands of roles before you're ready to play...

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:03.750
the role of the Scarlet Angel.

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:07.910
Ma'am, please tell me!

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:10.500
What kind of person is the Scarlet Angel?

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:18.640
She is not human.

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:22.640
She is a blossom; the spirit of a plum tree.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:31.710
She is not human.

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:35.730
She is a blossom; the spirit of a plum tree.

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:47.300
Don't come in anymore? What do you mean?

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:51.140
Look, you did a really good job, but I didn't realize you were still in junior high!

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:54.230
They've started cracking down on that recently...

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:57.110
Please don't take it personally.

00:12:57.110 --> 00:12:58.800
What am I going to do now?

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:02.180
They're still waiting for me to pay for my school trip.

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:06.230
Hey!

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:08.880
Sakurakouji!

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:10.100
What are you doing here?

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.370
Me? In Ondine?

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:20.210
Director Onodera was telling me it would be a shame to let your talents go...

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:22.600
to waste like this.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:24.770
Director Onodera?

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:27.820
Of course, all your expenses would be paid for.

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:32.250
You could rehearse without any worries.

00:13:33.690 --> 00:13:35.250
But I...

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:37.770
Let's rehearse together!

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:39.980
And then, maybe one day, we'll be on stage together!

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:45.090
I can't... I can't! I can't just betray everyone in my group like that...

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:47.320
Why is it betraying them?!

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:50.620
This is for you! You need to put yourself first!

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:55.150
I can't. I like everyone too much.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:58.510
More than me?

00:14:03.510 --> 00:14:04.770
I'm sorry!

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:09.420
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:14.620
Maya... I'm sorry. I didn't mean it like that.

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:19.370
Okay... I think it's time I left for now.

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:23.810
But please, think it over. I won't give up on you.

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:26.730
Sakurakouji!

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:32.700
Maya, have you brought the money for the school trip?

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:34.680
Sorry. I still haven't quite got it together yet.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:37.410
Well, I'm the one who'll get chewed out if you don't bring it in soon.

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:40.010
I'm really sorry.

00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:42.620
Hey, look at this! There's a free casting call for the role...

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:46.310
of a student in a movie with teen idol, Emi Abuchi!

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:48.020
I should try out for that!

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:51.470
Can I look at that too?

00:14:57.760 --> 00:15:00.400
I didn't think there'd be such a huge turnout!

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:03.040
And everyone's so pretty!

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.700
What am I going to do?

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:07.640
Can we have the first girl please?

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:08.080
Yes.

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:13.390
"Yoko was always so full of life! She wanted to be a tennis player..."

00:15:14.270 --> 00:15:16.030
Next up, Number Eighty-seven please.

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:17.510
Yes!

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:46.530
Number Eighty-seven... you're Maya Kitajima?

00:15:46.530 --> 00:15:48.590
Then, please go ahead.

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:50.730
Yes, sir!

00:15:57.910 --> 00:16:03.430
"I can't believe it! But Yoko was always so full of life!"

00:16:05.070 --> 00:16:07.570
"She wanted to be a tennis player so badly!"

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:12.850
"We were... always together! She was so kind!"

00:16:15.560 --> 00:16:19.000
"So, why?! <i>Why?!</i>"

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:23.180
"Why does she have to die?!"

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:31.430
Well, this one and this one could play the role.

00:16:31.430 --> 00:16:33.920
I personally liked this girl.

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:37.930
"Did you know that Kawamoto has a girlfriend?"

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.510
Now, you're shocked by it.

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:43.910
"Did you know that Kawamoto has a girlfriend?"

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:45.030
Now, with more malice...

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:49.760
"Did you know... that Kawamoto has a <i>girlfriend</i>?"

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:53.320
It looks like we're down to five...

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:59.390
It's a shame we're cutting Number Eighty-seven...

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:00.590
I can't put my finger on it...

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:05.390
She doesn't quite fit the part, but there's just something about the way she acts...

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:19.380
You there!

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:22.790
You're Number Eighty-seven, right?

00:17:23.840 --> 00:17:25.800
You're going to be in a movie?

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:27.520
But Maya, that's great!

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:29.820
I didn't pass the audition...

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:32.520
but they asked me if I'd be interested in a bit part...

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:34.290
The Assistant Director asked me himself.

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:35.660
So, what's the part?

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:38.260
I have to play a girl with an injured leg.

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:41.290
Wada Hospital

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:41.290
The starring role is played by teen idol, Emi Abuchi!

00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:45.790
She's just been told that she only has six months to live,

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:48.770
and I walk past her when she's still in shock.

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:53.590
And what are your lines?

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:56.840
"Here, you dropped this!"

00:17:58.550 --> 00:17:59.780
That's it?

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:01.090
Yup!

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:21.860
Just keep at it, Maya, until you fully understand.

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:28.690
New roles are born from pain.

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:03.280
Maya... you can't support your whole body on a lifeless leg.

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:06.680
You haven't become the role yet.

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:13.890
Become... the role?

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:20.140
Doctor, I thought I was just anemic...

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:23.610
This is rough...

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:25.140
Even more than I imagined it would be...

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:27.120
And how do you like being in movies?

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:29.570
Acting is fun!

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:31.150
Will you be pursuing a career as an actress?

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:34.690
Sure, why not? As long as it's fun...

00:19:35.390 --> 00:19:39.880
How can I make myself understand how difficult it is to lose the ability to use my left leg?

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:53.160
Now, in this scene, you're overcome with all sorts of anxieties regarding your illness.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:54.300
Do you understand?

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:55.880
Hm...

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:56.530
Emi...

00:19:56.530 --> 00:19:57.990
Then, please recite it.

00:19:57.990 --> 00:19:58.660
All right!

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:04.570
I still haven't quite managed to get in the head of a person with an injured leg,

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:07.830
so I thought I could perform like this during our rehearsals...

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:11.720
And action!

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:14.720
Emi, look down the hallway...

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:17.370
Are you all right?

00:20:17.810 --> 00:20:22.420
Um... it says in the script that I have to fall down... so I did.

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:25.040
Oh yeah... you're right!

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.540
Keep going, everyone!

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:29.970
Emi, at this point, you shouldn't be standing.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:36.300
Good morning!

00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:40.910
What's that girl doing?

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:44.340
She's been here for the last two hours, practicing that!

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:46.240
Two hours?!

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:49.390
She's practicing that hard for a measly bit part?

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:55.010
You liar!  I can't... play.. tennis!

00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:57.430
I keep telling you, you can't be that cheerful!

00:20:57.430 --> 00:20:58.340
Try again!

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:02.570
What? No, I can't do this... I don't want to do it anymore!

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.030
Let's take five.

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:04.950
Man oh man...

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.900
I was looking at this part, sir, and...

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:10.020
I finally understand what it feels like to be a girl who can't use her leg...

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:12.110
but refuses to give up!

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:14.890
Hey... why are you pushing yourself so hard?

00:21:15.630 --> 00:21:20.890
Because I love acting and I want to give it my very best!

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:25.890
You're weird. I mean, it's just a bit part.

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:30.950
I may be useless in everything else I do, but not when I'm acting.

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:35.980
When I'm in that world, I feel alive!

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:41.680
Maya will continue down her path, believing that the only glimmer of hope for her...

00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:43.980
is to give her best, regardless of what role she is playing.

00:21:43.980 --> 00:21:49.600
Will she ever achieve her goal of becoming a great actress?

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:03.930
Gomennette iwaretara

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:03.930
When you say "I'm sorry,"

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:10.670
Anata wo semerarenai yo

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:10.670
I can't blame you.

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:21.510
Sonna watashi wo kitto shitterundeshou

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:21.510
I'm sure you know that's how I am.

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:25.810
Nee zurui yo

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:25.810
That's not fair.

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:33.620
Yasashisa ni damasaretatte

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:33.620
Even if I'm being fooled by kindness,

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:44.210
Anata nara isso iito shinjita

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:44.210
I believed that with you, it might be worth it.

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:53.690
Sayonara wa doushite itoshiindarou

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:53.690
Why are goodbyes so precious,

00:22:53.690 --> 00:22:58.250
even though they mean we're separating?

00:22:53.690 --> 00:22:58.250
Hanareteyuku noni

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:07.640
I remember how it got colder.

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:07.640
Ushinatta ondo wo oboeteruyo

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:13.500
I want to forgive you, so please don't go.

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:13.500
Yurushitai dakara anata

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:21.410
Whatever you do... just don't go.

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:21.410
Ikanaide douka ikanaide

00:23:22.500 --> 00:23:28.270
I want to play the role that even the great Utako Himekawa has been refused for: the Scarlet Angel.

00:23:28.660 --> 00:23:33.080
To attain this role, I will take any part along the way and improve my abilities.

00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:37.640
You're also suffering all sorts of minor roles, aren't you, Maya?

00:23:37.950 --> 00:23:41.910
But now your troupe has been disbanded, it looks like Ms. Tsukikage...

00:23:41.910 --> 00:23:44.880
has become both mentally and physically weakened.

00:23:44.880 --> 00:23:49.090
What will happen to the rights to <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>?

00:23:47.000 --> 00:23:51.580
Episode 14 - Destined Rivals
